  ('ENG-0533', 'English', 'Reading and figurative language', 'Inference from a passage', 'moderate', 'Markhor Prep original question. PMDC MDCAT curriculum 2025, English learning outcome 1.1; NUMS MDCAT 2026 English benchmark 6.1', 'Read the passage and answer the question.
