Which action is most likely to increase antibiotic resistance?', '["Stopping a course of antibiotics as soon as one feels better", "Finishing the full course prescribed", "Not taking antibiotics for a cold", "Limiting antibiotic use in farm animals"]', 0, 'The passage says that stopping too early lets the hardiest bacteria survive, multiply and pass on resistance.', '{"1": "This is what doctors advise to prevent resistance.", "2": "Avoiding unnecessary antibiotics reduces resistance.", "3": "The passage presents this as a way to reduce the spread of resistance."}')
